<title>SOUTH KOREA: Inchon Iron H1 net profit up from yr ago.</title>
<headline>Inchon Iron H1 net profit up from yr ago.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		 930     vs    703</p>
<p>    Net			  14.88  vs     10.09</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	15.47  vs     12.12</p>
<p>    Turnover		  850.91  vs    759.12</p>
<p>NOTE - Inchon Iron and Steel Co is a unit of the Hyundai Group  HYGR.CN. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5646</p>
</text>
